      "text": "Streak"
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.tactical.objective",
      "text": "4 vs 4 in rounds, no respawns. Attackers plant the device at A or B ({Plantar}) and defenders guard it or defuse it. {Correr} walks slowly and silently (there's no sprinting). Your character's ability is used with {Habilidad}, and grenades are bought during the buy phase."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.tactical.win",
      "text": "You win the round if the device explodes, if you defuse it, or if you eliminate the whole other team (if time runs out without a plant, the defenders win). The first team to reach 7 rounds wins the match."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.tactical.lose",
      "text": "The team that doesn't reach 7 rounds loses. If you die, you spectate a teammate until the next round."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.deathmatch.objective",
      "text": "Free for all, up to 8 players. You pick your weapons for free ({Tienda}), each kill heals you 50 and you respawn after 3 s. Your ability is used with {Habilidad}. There are no shields or grenades."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.deathmatch.win",
      "text": "The first to reach 25 kills wins, or whoever has the most kills when the 8 minutes are up."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.deathmatch.lose",
      "text": "You lose if someone else reaches 25 kills first or has more kills than you when the clock runs out."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.invasion.objective",
      "text": "You alone against the horde at the university, for 10 waves. The boss appears on wave 10. With the points you earn you buy weapons, grenades and ammo between waves."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.invasion.win",
      "text": "You win if you survive all 10 waves. After that you can keep going in endless mode to set a record."
    },
    {
      "key": "gameplay.mode.invasion.lose",
      "text": "You lose if the zombies kill you."
    },
